# ---- Build output ----
bin/
obj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
artifacts/
*.dll
*.pdb

# ---- Databases ----
# SQLite lives on a persistent volume in production and is generated locally
# by seeding on first run. Never commit one: it is customer data.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ---- Secrets & environment ----
# The admin API key is supplied by `dotnet user-secrets` locally and by the
# ADERFIA_ADMIN_KEY environment variable in production. It is never in a
# tracked file. .env.production.example documents the shape and IS tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example
secrets.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
ADMIN_KEY.txt

# ---- Generated deployment artifacts ----
# The EF idempotent migration script, regenerated on demand with
# `dotnet ef migrations script --idempotent`. It holds no secrets, but it goes
# stale the moment a migration is added, and a stale copy in source control is
# worse than none. Anchored with a leading slash so it only matches the root
# file — deliberately NOT *.sql, so hand-written scripts can still be tracked.
/schema.sql

# ---- Editors / IDE ----
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs
*.swp

# ---- Logs ----
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
*.log

# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
